#: /Users/miroslavbauer/Code/github.com/EOSC-CZ/nma/templates/semantic-ui/invenio_app_rdm/intro_section.html:18
msgid ""
"The National Metadata Directory (NMD) is a central aggregator of metadata"
" for scientific datasets in the Czech Republic. The NMD collects metadata"
" from all repositories within the National Repository Platform and from "
"other repositories containing datasets created by the Czech academic "
"community. It serves as the primary discovery point across repositories "
"and directs users to the primary repositories where the datasets reside."
msgstr ""

